{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#card-zh","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 是面向 DSH Web 的远程访问插件：它在本机启动独立网关，将官方 Web 界面和 API 请求代理到 DSH 的回环 Web 服务，并通过一次性二维码或短码配对建立设备会话。网关还提供 mDNS 局域网发现、连接状态页和空闲 WebSocket 保活；聊天工具可生成配对码、列出或撤销设备、设置恢复码，以及把当前会话分叉为继承既有上下文的子会话。适合希望用手机访问桌面 DSH、管理已配对设备或保留当前对话另试方向的用户。可选配置 Bark、ntfy 或 webhook 接收离线待处理提醒；默认开启配对和 mDNS，网关端口为 3081。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:48","src/index.js:169","src/config.js:42"]}
{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#card-en","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-remote-link provides remote access to the DSH Web client through a local gateway and one-time QR or short-code pairing. It supports device management, LAN discovery, connection status, optional offline alerts, and forking a conversation with its context. Pairing and mDNS are enabled by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:48","src/index.js:169","src/config.js:42"]}
