{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#feature-9","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 的功能「手机配对访问」：网关提供一次性二维码和短码入口，手机完成配对后通过会话访问转发的官方 DSH Web 界面与 API。可从聊天工具生成配对码。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:89","src/tools.js:30"]}
{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#feature-10","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 的功能「配对设备管理」：聊天工具可列出已配对设备，并按设备名称或 ID 撤销单台设备，也可一次撤销全部设备。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:79"]}
{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#feature-11","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 的功能「会话分叉」：调用 fork_session 后，以最近完成回合为界创建继承上下文的子会话，并尝试将其重新挂到原工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/fork-session.js:1","src/fork-session.js:75"]}
{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#feature-12","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 的功能「离线提醒」：配置 Bark、ntfy 或 webhook 后，在没有浏览器连接时，将待审批或待回答事件通知到配置的渠道。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:116","src/notify.js:12"]}
{"unit_id":"BotonJ__dsh-remote-link#feature-13","repo":"BotonJ/dsh-remote-link","commit":"f7a444eb6e0254c1c2f79a54d8389c01886dfc7f","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-link 的功能「恢复码管理」：聊天工具可生成并启用长期恢复码，或查询恢复码状态；恢复码可用于设备全部丢失后的重新配对。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.js:125"]}
